        ex:hasText "Moreover, we capability for carbon reporting will enable we to monitor and manage the carbon intensity of we managed assistants, ensuring transparency in we environmental impact. we has a published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year, demonstrating we commitment to continuous improvement in sustainability." ;
